      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- still testing using HTTP \n    - system testing stuff\n- Lets us mix in Unit test where we need it (like validations)\n- Hosts the API for us.\n    - Our tests will start up the API, and won't run until it starts.\n    - We have some \"hooks\" to see what is going on inside the API\n     - Use test doubles (mocks, stubs, fakes, etc.)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- still testing using HTTP \n    - system testing stuff\n- Lets us mix in Unit test where we need it (like validations)\n- Hosts the API for us.\n    - Our tests will start up the API, and won't run until it starts.\n    - We have some \"hooks\" to see what is going on inside the API\n     - Use test doubles (mocks, stubs, fakes, etc.)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
